    Update merge conflict label action to v3 (#8169)
    
    The `releases/2.x` branch of this action declares Node.js 16 as its
    runtime. GitHub removed Node.js 20 from its runners in September 2026
    and Node.js 24 is the only runtime left, so this only still works as
    long as the runner keeps forcing old actions onto the newer runtime.
    Version 3 declares Node.js 24. Its inputs are unchanged.
    
    Referencing a tag instead of a branch also lets Dependabot keep the
    action up to date from now on.
    
